---
title: "listActiveRounds (Legion: API Integration Flow)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_receive: GET /v1/integration/rounds
    q_receive --> q_auth: validate JWT token
    q_auth --> q_unauthorized: token invalid or missing
    q_unauthorized --> [*]: return 401 unauthorized
    q_auth --> q_query: token valid
    q_query --> q_filter: query all rounds
    q_filter --> q_return: filter active rounds only
    q_return --> [*]: return array of active rounds

    note right of q_auth
        INV-001: only authenticated users may list rounds
        INV-002: only currently active rounds are returned
    end note
